msgid ""
"The FV_annuity() function tells you how much money you will have on your "
"account after a certain amount of periods. We assume that you have initially "
"some money and get a certain interest. In addition you put each period some "
"amount of money in addition on your account. Lets have an example: Imagine "
"you have $1000 on your bank account. At the end of every year you add $100 "
"and your interest is 8%. PV_annuity( 100; 0.08; 2; 1000; FALSE ) tells you "
"that after two years you will own $1374.40. If you pay the $100 at the "
"beginning of each year then choose TRUE as the last parameter."
msgstr ""

